          <h1>2026 State Election Ballot Questions</h1>
    
    

    <div class="column g--8">

         <div class="intro-text supporting-text squiggle-border-bottom field field-name-field-intro-text field-type-text-long"><p>The questions below will appear on the ballot in the upcoming State Election on&nbsp;Tuesday, November 3, 2026.</p>
</div>


      
